sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant APIServer as vLLM API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>SHA-256 Token Compare
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>Scheduler + KV Cache
    participant Workers as Worker Processes<br/>Fork / ZMQ IPC
    participant Model as Model Weights<br/>Filesystem (read-only)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over APIServer,HFHub: Flow 1: Model Download (Startup)
    APIServer->>HFHub: GET model artifacts<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (Bearer)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    HFHub-->>APIServer: Model weights + config
    APIServer->>Model: Write to local filesystem

    Note over Client,Workers: Flow 2: Inference Request
    Client->>APIServer: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)<br/>TLS: Optional
    APIServer->>Auth: Validate token<br/>(SHA-256 + secrets.compare_digest)
    Auth-->>APIServer: Authenticated
    APIServer->>Engine: Submit inference request
    Engine->>Workers: Schedule on worker<br/>(ZMQ IPC / fork)
    Workers->>Model: Load model weights<br/>(memory-mapped)
    Model-->>Workers: Tensor data
    Workers-->>Engine: Generated tokens<br/>(streaming)
    Engine-->>APIServer: Token stream
    APIServer-->>Client: SSE / JSON Response

    Note over Client,Workers: Flow 3: LoRA Adapter Hot-Load
    Client->>APIServer: POST /v1/load_lora_adapter<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    APIServer->>Engine: Load adapter
    Engine->>S3: Download adapter<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / Access Key<br/>TLS 1.2+
    S3-->>Engine: LoRA weights
    Engine-->>APIServer: Adapter loaded
    APIServer-->>Client: 200 OK
